{"seq":2,"slug":"job-observability-alert","title":"任务执行监控、延迟与漏跑告警","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/distributed-job-scheduling/operations/job-observability-alert","wordCount":2823,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"任务执行监控-延迟与漏跑告警\">任务执行监控、延迟与漏跑告警</h1><p>监控一个调度系统，直觉上应该盯「失败的任务」，但这个直觉是错的。调度系统最严重的故障不是任务失败——失败至少会产生错误日志和失败计数，是可发现的；最严重的是<strong>任务该跑而没跑</strong>：调度器停止工作、实例没能创建、租约丢失导致任务被静默丢弃、misfire 策略把窗口悄悄折叠。这些情况下系统里没有任何错误码，所有已有的任务执行记录都是成功的，只有「应该存在的执行记录不存在」。因此本节的核心论点是：<strong>调度系统的第一监控指标是「预期触发次数与实际执行次数之差」，而不是失败率</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-把-缺席-变成可度量的信号\">核心概念：把「缺席」变成可度量的信号</h2><p>「某个任务今天该跑 24 次、实际跑了 23 次」这个事实，在系统里没有任何一条记录直接表达它——因为缺失本身就是没有记录。要让缺席可见，必须引入一个<strong>预期量</strong>作为参照。这个参照可以从触发计划推导出来：给定任务的时间表与观察区间，预期触发次数是可计算的（cron 表达式在区间内的匹配次数，或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><mtext>区间长度</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lfloor \\text{区间长度} / P \\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">区间长度</span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span></span></span></span></span>）。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>漏跑数</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>预期触发次数</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>start</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>end</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mtext>实际实例数</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>start</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>end</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{漏跑数} = \\text{预期触发次数}(T_{\\text{start}}, T_{\\text{end}}) - \\text{实际实例数}(T_{\\text{start}}, T_{\\text{end}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">漏跑数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">预期触发次数</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">start</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">end</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">实际实例数</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">start</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">end</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  C[&quot;触发计划&lt;br/&gt;cron 表达式&quot;] --&gt; EXP[&quot;预期实例数&lt;br/&gt;区间内匹配次数&quot;]&#10;  ST[(实例表)] --&gt; ACT[&quot;实际实例数&lt;br/&gt;按状态分组计数&quot;]&#10;  EXP --&gt; DIFF{&quot;差值判定&quot;}&#10;  ACT --&gt; DIFF&#10;  DIFF --&gt;|差 &gt; 0| MISS[&quot;漏跑告警&lt;br/&gt;缺了几个窗口&quot;]&#10;  DIFF --&gt;|差 &lt; 0| DUP[&quot;重复告警&lt;br/&gt;防重失效&quot;]&#10;  DIFF --&gt;|差 = 0| OK[&quot;正常&quot;]&#10;  ACT --&gt; LAG[&quot;调度延迟 lag&lt;br/&gt;开始时刻 - 计划时刻&quot;]&#10;  LAG --&gt; ALERT2[&quot;延迟增长告警&lt;br/&gt;容量不足早期信号&quot;]\">graph TD\n  C[\"触发计划&lt;br/&gt;cron 表达式\"] --&gt; EXP[\"预期实例数&lt;br/&gt;区间内匹配次数\"]\n  ST[(实例表)] --&gt; ACT[\"实际实例数&lt;br/&gt;按状态分组计数\"]\n  EXP --&gt; DIFF{\"差值判定\"}\n  ACT --&gt; DIFF\n  DIFF --&gt;|差 &gt; 0| MISS[\"漏跑告警&lt;br/&gt;缺了几个窗口\"]\n  DIFF --&gt;|差 &lt; 0| DUP[\"重复告警&lt;br/&gt;防重失效\"]\n  DIFF --&gt;|差 = 0| OK[\"正常\"]\n  ACT --&gt; LAG[\"调度延迟 lag&lt;br/&gt;开始时刻 - 计划时刻\"]\n  LAG --&gt; ALERT2[\"延迟增长告警&lt;br/&gt;容量不足早期信号\"]</pre><p>这张图里有三个独立的信号：漏跑（数量缺口）、重复（数量超出）、延迟（时间偏离）。它们需要分别监控，因为成因完全不同：漏跑通常是调度器故障或 misfire 误配，重复通常是防重机制失效，延迟通常是容量或性能问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"必须采集的指标集合\">必须采集的指标集合</h2><p>一个可用的调度系统监控至少有五组指标。下面给出每组的定义、采集点与健康判据。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标组</th>\n<th>具体指标</th>\n<th>采集点</th>\n<th>健康判据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>调度时效</td>\n<td>调度延迟 lag = <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_n - T_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>实例创建时记录</td>\n<td>稳定且小于扫描间隔</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调度时效</td>\n<td>实际触发周期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>P</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>相邻实例的开始时刻差</td>\n<td>与声明周期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 偏差小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>执行结果</td>\n<td>成功/失败/超时/取消计数</td>\n<td>执行器上报</td>\n<td>失败率在 SLO 内</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>执行结果</td>\n<td>执行耗时分布（p50/p95/p99）</td>\n<td>执行器上报</td>\n<td>趋势平稳，突变告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缺口</td>\n<td>预期次数 - 实际次数</td>\n<td>调度器周期计算</td>\n<td>恒为 0，非 0 立即告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缺口</td>\n<td>misfire 计数与丢弃计数</td>\n<td>misfire 处理路径</td>\n<td>丢弃必须告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基础设施</td>\n<td>心跳缺失的执行器数</td>\n<td>调度器扫描</td>\n<td>恒为 0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基础设施</td>\n<td>leader 租约持有者变更次数</td>\n<td>调度器选主路径</td>\n<td>变更即告警（说明发生转移）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基础设施</td>\n<td>僵死实例数（RUNNING 但租约过期）</td>\n<td>回收扫描</td>\n<td>恒为 0</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关于「调度延迟」这个指标还有一个细节值得注意：它只能在<strong>实例被创建之后</strong>才能测量（因为需要一个开始时刻）。如果调度器完全停止工作，实例根本不会被创建，也就没有 lag 数据——此时 lag 指标会「缺数据」而不是「变差」。这正是为什么缺口指标必须独立存在：它是唯一能捕捉「完全静止」的信号。在告警实现上，这类「缺席」通常靠 PromQL 的 <code>absent()</code> 表达——它「return an empty vector if the vector passed to it has any elements」，仅当选择器匹配不到任何序列时返回一个值为 1 的单元素向量，官方定位即「useful for alerting on when no time series exist for a given metric name and label combination」（来源：Prometheus Querying Functions, <a href=\"https://prometheus.io/docs/prometheus/latest/querying/functions/）。实践中，一个实用的兜底是让每个任务有一个**心跳检查**：如果某任务在超过「周期\">https://prometheus.io/docs/prometheus/latest/querying/functions/）。实践中，一个实用的兜底是让每个任务有一个**心跳检查**：如果某任务在超过「周期</a> × 3 + 容差」的时间内没有任何新实例，就产生一个「疑似停摆」告警，不依赖任何实例数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"告警设计-分层与降噪\">告警设计：分层与降噪</h2><p>调度系统的告警很容易失控，因为每次批量故障都会产生成百上千条任务级告警（一次数据库故障可能让 500 个任务同时失败）。因此告警必须分层。</p>\n<p><strong>第一层：系统级（影响全部任务）</strong>。调度器无 leader、调度存储不可写、所有执行器心跳缺失。这类告警优先级最高、数量最少，应直接呼叫值班。判据设计成「全局性」的，例如「最近 5 分钟内创建的实例数为 0 而预期大于 0」。</p>\n<p><strong>第二层：任务级关键告警</strong>。特定任务的漏跑、持续失败、执行耗时突增。这类需要去重与聚合：同一个任务的连续失败应合并为一条告警（附带失败次数），而不是每轮一条。多数任务其实不需要实时告警——日报失败明天早上看到也来得及。</p>\n<p><strong>第三层：趋势与容量告警</strong>。调度延迟持续增长、执行耗时 p99 缓慢上升、补跑积压增加。这类不紧急但重要，是「即将出问题」的早期信号，应该进入日报或周报而不是实时告警。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>优先级</th>\n<th>通知方式</th>\n<th>去重策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>系统级</td>\n<td>无 leader、存储不可写、全局零实例</td>\n<td>P0</td>\n<td>电话/值班</td>\n<td>不适用（本就稀少）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>任务级关键</td>\n<td>漏跑、持续失败、超时</td>\n<td>P1</td>\n<td>群消息</td>\n<td>按任务聚合，连续失败合并</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>任务级一般</td>\n<td>单次失败、单次超时重试成功</td>\n<td>P2</td>\n<td>日报</td>\n<td>只统计不实时推</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>趋势容量</td>\n<td>lag 增长、耗时 p99 上升</td>\n<td>P2/P3</td>\n<td>周报</td>\n<td>趋势阈值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>告警设计的另一个要点是<strong>告警必须携带足够的上下文</strong>。一条「任务 X 漏跑」的告警，如果只说任务名，值班的人还要自己去查「预期几个、实际几个、缺哪个窗口、是不是被 misfire 折叠了」。好的告警直接包含这些：<code>job=report_daily 预期=24 实际=23 缺失窗口=[2026-09-25T02:00Z] 原因=misfire_folded</code>。这个上下文必须由漏跑检测逻辑主动计算并附加，而不是事后人工查询。</p>\n<h2 id=\"执行日志的归档与检索\">执行日志的归档与检索</h2><p>任务执行日志是排查的主要依据，但它的存储策略需要设计，否则很快会失控。一个每 5 分钟执行的任务，一年产生约 10 万个实例；如果每个实例保留 1 MB 日志，就是 100 GB。</p>\n<p>实用的策略是<strong>分级保留</strong>：所有实例的状态记录（状态、耗时、退出码、分片、窗口）长期保留，因为它们是体积最小、查询最频繁、也是缺口检测的数据源；日志正文按状态分级——<strong>失败的实例长期保留</strong>（因为要排查），<strong>成功的实例短期保留</strong>（比如 7 天或 30 天），更早的成功日志转冷存储或直接删除。这个策略背后是一个简单判断：人们查询失败日志的概率远高于查询成功日志。</p>\n<p>检索设计上要支持两个维度：按<strong>任务</strong>查（某任务最近 20 次执行）、按<strong>窗口</strong>查（某天所有任务在 02:00 到 03:00 之间的执行情况）。后者在事故复盘时特别有用：当发现某段时间系统异常时，需要能一次性看到那个时间窗内所有任务的状态，而不是逐个任务翻。这要求实例表有 <code>fire_time</code> 与 <code>started_at</code> 的联合索引。</p>\n<p>日志内容本身也需要注意隐私与成本：日志里不应默认打印完整的业务数据与标识符（见 <code>[[privacy-by-design]]</code> 的日志条目），通常用行数、错误类、采样后的样例就足够定位问题。这个约束在调度系统里格外重要，因为任务日志由框架自动收集和存储，很容易变成全量业务数据的副本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用指标驱动容量决策\">用指标驱动容量决策</h2><p>监控数据除了告警，还应该驱动容量决策。几个可直接使用的推导。</p>\n<p><strong>执行器容量</strong>：设某任务组的总分片数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>，单分片平均耗时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>d</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8312em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8312em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，允许的完成时间窗口为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>，则需要的最小执行器数（假设每执行器一个并发）为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>d</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{\\min} = \\lceil N \\cdot \\bar d / W \\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0812em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8312em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span>。如果实际执行器数接近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，说明没有冗余，任何一台变慢都会导致窗口超时。</p>\n<p>这张表背后是一个通用取向：指标不是为了「看」，而是为了反推配置决策。Google SRE 把这类「必须先看的量」归纳为四个黄金信号——latency、traffic、errors、saturation，其中 saturation 的定义就是「how &#39;full&#39; your service is」，聚焦最受限的那类资源（内存、I/O、CPU、网络），并指出「rising tail latency can be an early warning sign」（来源：Google SRE Book — Monitoring Distributed Systems, <a href=\"https://sre.google/sre-book/monitoring-distributed-systems/）。本节的\">https://sre.google/sre-book/monitoring-distributed-systems/）。本节的</a> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、扫描耗时与实例增长率，都是把这条思路落到调度系统上的具体形式。</p>\n<p><strong>调度扫描容量</strong>：调度器每轮扫描的任务数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span>，扫描耗时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>，扫描间隔为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span>，则需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s &lt; I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 且推荐 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s &lt; I / 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord\">/3</span></span></span></span></span>。如果扫描耗时接近间隔，调度延迟 lag 会增长——这是 lag 增长的常见成因之一。</p>\n<p><strong>存储容量</strong>：实例记录的增长速率为「任务数 × 平均触发频率」，可以直接外推磁盘与索引需求；如果几个月的实例表增长到需要分区，应在设计时就按 <code>fire_time</code> 做表分区。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>决策</th>\n<th>公式 / 判据</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>最小执行器数</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><mi>N</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>d</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{\\min} = \\lceil N\\bar d / W \\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0812em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8312em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>分片数、耗时分布、完成窗口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调度器数</td>\n<td>扫描耗时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s &lt; I/3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord\">/3</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>扫描耗时、扫描间隔</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实例表分区</td>\n<td>按 <code>fire_time</code> 月度分区</td>\n<td>实例增长率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日志保留期</td>\n<td>按失败率与排查需求</td>\n<td>存储成本、查询频率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>补跑并发上限</td>\n<td>下游容量 / 单实例 QPS</td>\n<td>下游限流阈值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>调度系统的第一监控指标是<strong>预期触发次数与实际执行次数之差</strong>，而非失败率——失败可见，缺席不可见。</li>\n<li>三类独立信号：漏跑（数量缺口）、重复（数量超出）、延迟（时间偏离），成因与对策各不相同。</li>\n<li>完全静止的故障会让 lag 指标缺数据而非变差，因此必须有「疑似停摆」的兜底检查（超周期 × 3 无新实例）。</li>\n<li>告警分三层：系统级（P0，全局零实例）、任务级关键（P1，聚合去重）、趋势容量（日报/周报）；告警必须自带上下文（预期数、实际数、缺失窗口、原因）。</li>\n<li>日志分级保留：状态记录长期留，失败日志长期留，成功日志短期留；检索需支持按任务与按时间窗两个维度。</li>\n<li>监控数据应驱动容量决策：执行器数、调度器数与扫描间隔、实例表分区、补跑并发上限都可从指标反推。</li>\n<li>下一步读 <a href=\"idempotent-jobs\">任务幂等与失败重试纪律</a>，把失败处理从「重试几次」变成可判断的规则。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"任务执行监控、延迟与漏跑告警","id":"任务执行监控-延迟与漏跑告警"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：把「缺席」变成可度量的信号","id":"核心概念-把-缺席-变成可度量的信号"},{"level":2,"text":"必须采集的指标集合","id":"必须采集的指标集合"},{"level":2,"text":"告警设计：分层与降噪","id":"告警设计-分层与降噪"},{"level":2,"text":"执行日志的归档与检索","id":"执行日志的归档与检索"},{"level":2,"text":"用指标驱动容量决策","id":"用指标驱动容量决策"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"调度器高可用与故障转移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/distributed-job-scheduling/operations/scheduler-ha-failover"},"next":{"title":"任务幂等与失败重试纪律","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/distributed-job-scheduling/operations/idempotent-jobs"}}